<title>TURKEY: TURK STATE ZIRAATBANK UPS CAPITAL TO 100 TRLN LIRA.</title>
<headline>TURK STATE ZIRAATBANK UPS CAPITAL TO 100 TRLN LIRA.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's biggest state-run Ziraat Bankasi raised its capital to 100 trillion lira ($610.5 million) from 20 trillion, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said Turkey's Higher Planning Board increased the bank's capital in line with a government decree.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875. ATA EKS ($ = 163800 Turkish Lire)</p>
